":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 07-10-2018, 02:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-10T12:15:03-07:00","id":1233778,"title":"","content":"What\u2019s your thoughts on Pok\u00e9mon let\u2019s go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-10T12:36:05-07:00","id":1233780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1233546-let\u2019s-talk-about-pok\u00e9mon?p=1233778#post1233778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What\u2019s your thoughts on Pok\u00e9mon let\u2019s go?</div> </div> </div> </div>As I said in my first post, I think it\u2019s a very smart move on Nontendo\u2019s part. I\u2019m excited for it. I don\u2019t get the fuss over no wild battles. They were a nuisance anyway and I always avoided them as much as possible. Plus you get XP from catching wild Pok\u00e9mon and EVs from candies, which you get from transferring Pok\u00e9mon to the professor, so it won\u2019t mess up progression. Giving Pikachu double-kick early on is a good idea. I\u2019ve known too many people who gave up on yellow as kids because they couldn\u2019t beat Brock and didn\u2019t know Mankey, Nidoran, or Butterfree would do the trick. Being able to walk with any of your Pok\u00e9mon outside the ball is an oft-requested feature that people don\u2019t realize how much time and money it would take to implement in a Modern Pok\u00e9mon game, and a Yellow remake is the perfect place for it. Being able to bring Pok\u00e9mon in from Go once you reach the safari zone is cool, though I probably won\u2019t use it much. Two-player is a nice touch for the Switch, even if it\u2019s a little barebones. Pokeball Plus is awesome.<br /> <br /> On the critical side... It\u2019s a bummer you can\u2019t evolve your starter Eevee. I get that it would triple the models and animations needed for the starter riding on your head, but still. Evolving is kinda Eevee\u2019s gimmick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-10T13:44:49-07:00","id":1233793,"title":"","content":"Any of you play the TCG?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/