-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woohoo What whould be the Silver ladders signature Pok\u00e9mon?</div> </div> </div> </div>Just my opinion, but if we're only using Gen 1, these would be my best guesses:<br /> <br /> <br /> Clefairy - From the moon, you say? Along with the occasional &quot;moon stone&quot; object with unusual powers? I'll get my coat.<br /> <br /> Magikarp - You're telling me that this useless aquatic specimen can become something extraordinary with just &quot;a little effort and patience&quot;? We'll see about that. It might grow less shabby scales or something.<br /> <br /> Eevee - Its genetic flexibility makes it full of possibilities, especially with some Life magic..<br /> <br /> Ditto - Ditto.<br /> <br /> Mew/Mewtwo - We all watched that first movie, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 07-11-2018, 09:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T06:51:36-07:00","id":1233981,"title":"","content":"What about the other orders the free council would of course have a porgon of course","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"atta