","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T07:29:15-07:00","id":1233993,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Golett_(Pok%C3%A9mon\" target=\"_blank\">https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/w..._(Pok%C3%A9mon</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T09:04:01-07:00","id":1234296,"title":"","content":"Meow what would the SOTT Pok\u00e9mon be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T10:53:55-07:00","id":1234331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1233546-let\u2019s-talk-about-pok\u00e9mon?p=1233581#post1233581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, is it weird to anyone else that the human soul demonstrably exists in the Pok\u00e9mon universe, and your afterlife might consist of being captured by a ten-year-old and made to fight their battles for them?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Baring in mind that one of those ghost types steals people's souls if they peer into the hole on its back. And guess what direction pokemon are facing when you send them into battle!<br /> <br /> How about the fact there is a literal grim reaper (Dusknoir) who drags souls to the underworld?<br /> <br /> Or that the very creator of the universe itself is, in fact, a pokemon!<br /> <br /> <br /> But on a more cheery note, you don't necessarily have to die to become a pokemon. There are canonical examples both in game and even the anime itself where humans have spontaneously transformed through various means.<br /> <br /> <br /> Bill was turned into a Kabuto when his teleporter malfunctioned. (This was changed to him being stuck in a costume in the anime)<br /> <br /> Ash was turned into a pikachu when he was accidentally exposed to a witch's potion.<br /> <br /> The pokedex mentions a story about a human boy with psychic powers waking up one day to find out he was transformed into a Kadabra<br /> <br /> And if the Mystery Dungeon games are included, there's a chance you can wake up in a land populated entirely by pokemon with total amnesia as to how you got there!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1233546-let\u2019s-talk-about-pok\u00e9mon?p=1233614#post1233614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anything related to reproduction, death, and food in the Pok\u00e9mon universe falls apart if you look at it too closely. Mostly because the Pok\u00e9mon company insists on never acknowledging that Pok\u00e9mon ever breed, die, or eat anything that isn\u2019t a berry or berry byproduct.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Unless you count the manga, in which case they make it very clear that pokemon do, in fact, die. Red's Pikachu blew up Brock's Onix with a thunder bolt. Charmeleon used Slash to decapitate an Arbok. The &quot;ghosts&quot; of Lavender Town are actual zombies, complete with rotting corpses and a hunger for living flesh. And the move &quot;Acid&quot; melts the flesh off a psyduck, leaving it as noting both a pile of bones.<br /> <br /> Also, there's a newspaper article that heavily implies a trainer gets raped by her Tentacruel while taking a bath with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-12-2018, 02:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T13:36:43-07:00","id":1234382,"title":"","content":"I think it was the trainer that raped the tentercrual","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T13:42:31-07:00","id":1234383,"title":"","content":"Man that's some pretty dark stuff. I got the first volume of the manga for my son but he's had no interest in reading it, though he likes Pokemon in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T14:12:05-07:00","id":1234392,"title":"","content":"I do to what\u2019s your favorite spinoff?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-12T14:18:40-07:00","id":1234397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1233546-let\u2019s-talk-about-pok\u00e9mon?p=1234382#post1234382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it was the trainer that raped the tentercrual</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The article has a quote from the trainer that says &quot;That's the last time I take a bath with my Tentacruel!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div clas